"1_1": {
"dialogue": "RAWR xd",
"offset": Vector2(-1500, -300),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": ""
},
"1_10": {
"dialogue": "Aqua's experiments are just in this room here.",
"offset": Vector2(-1760, 3440),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_11": {
"dialogue": "I like your enthusiasm!",
"offset": Vector2(-603.3, 544.271),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_12": {
"dialogue": "There's some Rust Slimes in the next room. If you want to practice, they're basically mini versions of the boss. ",
"offset": Vector2(-260, 240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_13": {
"dialogue": "Hmm, well this isn't very peaceful... But its important to learn, so bear with me. Sorry.",
"offset": Vector2(-1600, 940),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_14": {
"dialogue": "To start, click the Attacks button, then select the [el]Green[/el] attack. [br][br]Press Space when you've done so.
",
"offset": Vector2(-1180, 860),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_15",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_15": {
"dialogue": "Great! Now hover your mouse over the enemy.  
[br][br][b]Space[/b]",
"offset": Vector2(-840, 860),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_18",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_16": {
"dialogue": "Here, I'll show you. Follow me.",
"offset": Vector2(-257.222, -60.3562),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_17": {
"dialogue": "Ah, here we go",
"offset": Vector2(413.689, -60.4633),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_2",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_18": {
"dialogue": "Now what you're seeing is called the [i]transmutation hint[/i]. It might not make much sense, but that's okay. 
[br][br]Just remember that the top-right square is [el]cyan[/el].
[br][br][b]Space[/b]",
"offset": Vector2(-500, 860),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_19",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_19": {
"dialogue": "Now click on the enemy and press the \"End Turn\" button below.",
"offset": Vector2(-180, 860),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_2": {
"dialogue": "",
"offset": Vector2(-1500, -620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": ""
},
"1_20": {
"dialogue": "",
"offset": Vector2(-2260, 4040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_21": {
"dialogue": "My attack channeled the elemental power of [el]Green[/el], which reacted with the opponent's [el]Blue[/el] typing to create [el]Cyan[/el].",
"offset": Vector2(-2040, 1540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_22",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_22": {
"dialogue": "What's more, these reactions have side effects! Elements are broken into 2 subgroups: [color=blue]Defensive[/color] and [color=red]Offensive[/color].
",
"offset": Vector2(-1700, 1540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_24",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_23": {
"dialogue": "When you go from:
[ul][color=blue]Defensive[/color] -> [color=blue]Defensive[/color] = Speed boost.[/ul]
[ul][color=red]Offensive[/color] -> [color=red]Offensive[/color] = Speed boost.[/ul]
[ul][color=red]Offensive[/color] -> [color=blue]Defensive[/color] = Defense boost.[/ul]
[ul] [color=blue]Defensive[/color] -> [color=red]Offensive[/color] = Attack boost.[/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-680, 1540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_26",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_24": {
"dialogue": "Defensive Types:
[ul][el]Blue[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Cyan[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Magenta[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Yellow[/el][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1360, 1540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_25",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_25": {
"dialogue": "Offensive Types:
[ul][el]Green[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Purple[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Orange[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Red[/el][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1020, 1540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_23",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_26": {
"dialogue": "Press [i]T[/i] to pull up the Transmutation Menu. The second tab contains the type chart. Hover over any of the squares will show you that combos side effects.",
"offset": Vector2(-340, 1540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_27": {
"dialogue": "Now I have 2 more things to show you.",
"offset": Vector2(-2020, 1840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_28",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_28": {
"dialogue": "You probably noticed that I have 2  colors, while the opponent only has 1.",
"offset": Vector2(-1680, 1840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_29",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_29": {
"dialogue": "The first 2 rows of a transmutation hint shows how those 2 types will react to an attack.",
"offset": Vector2(-1340, 1840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_41",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_3": {
"dialogue": "Hey there",
"offset": Vector2(-2020, 120),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_4",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_4": {
"dialogue": "Did you just wash up?",
"offset": Vector2(-1680, 120),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_41": {
"dialogue": "You may have guessed what the 3rd row is hinting to you, but if not watch how my typing reacts to the opponent's next attack.",
"offset": Vector2(-1158.54, 2484.62),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_42": {
"dialogue": "So not only will your typing react to your opponent's attacks (and vice versa), but your primary and secondary types can react together!",
"offset": Vector2(-2020, 2140),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_43",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_43": {
"dialogue": "Finally, just one more thing.
[br][br]So far, we've only been using [i]ranged[/i] attacks. Watch what happens when the opponent uses a melee attack instead.",
"offset": Vector2(-1680, 2140),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_44": {
"dialogue": "But more importantly, using a ranged attack will only affect your opponent's typing. However, melee attacks will affect both the target and the user.",
"offset": Vector2(-1660, 2460),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_45": {
"dialogue": "asdf",
"offset": Vector2(-2260, 3740),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([{
"cur_variable": 3,
"operator": 0,
"value1": "puzzle_1",
"value2": "true"
}]),
"link": "END",
"text": "Puzzle 1 is active"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 258),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_46": {
"dialogue": "If your second type is Gray (Blank), it will change to match the attack you used.",
"offset": Vector2(-2000, 2460),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_44",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_5": {
"dialogue": "I know we just met, but I have a small favor to ask.",
"offset": Vector2(-1341.12, 123.14),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_6",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_6": {
"dialogue": "There's a particular monster up ahead I'd like your help with.",
"offset": Vector2(-1000.97, 120.269),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_7",
"text": "I don't know how to fight..."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_9",
"text": "I don't know about that"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_11",
"text": "Sure!"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 323),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_7": {
"dialogue": "Well that's a useful skill to learn, even if you don't help me with the big guy",
"offset": Vector2(-600, -60),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_16",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_8": {
"dialogue": "You know what? This works too.",
"offset": Vector2(-1600, 1240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_9": {
"dialogue": "Thats' okay. If you don't want to, you don't want to.",
"offset": Vector2(-600, 240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_12",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"2_3": {
"comment": "[ul]When a [color=blue]defensive element[/color] transmute into another [color=blue]defensive element[/color], they get a speed boost.[/ul]
[ul]The same goes for when a [color=red]offensive element[/color] transmutes into another [color=red]offensive element[/color].[/ul]
[ul]When a [color=red]offensive element[/color] transmutes into a  [color=blue]defensive element[/color], they get a defensive bonus.[/ul]
[ul] When a [color=blue]defensive element[/color] transmutes into a  [color=red]offensive element[/color], they get an offensive bonus.[/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1276.8, 1922.8),
"size": Vector2(200, 100)
},
